                <li>To deliver and maintain our free educational content and tools.</li>
                <li>To analyze aggregated usage trends and improve platform performance.</li>
                <li>To serve relevant advertisements through our advertising partners.</li>
                <li>To ensure the security and integrity of our website.</li>
            </ul>

