            <h4 class="mt-4">5. Advertising</h4>
            <p>We partner with Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website and other sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalized advertising at any time:</p>
            <ul>
