                <li><a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Digital Advertising Alliance Opt-Out</a></li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-4">6. Data Storage and Security</h4>
            <p>We do not maintain user accounts or databases containing personal information. All user preferences and session data are stored locally in your browser (Local Storage). This means:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your data stays on your device — we never upload it to our servers.</li>
                <li>Clearing your browser data will reset all local preferences.</li>
                <li>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect our website infrastructure.</li>
            </ul>

